"""Bitmap font data, generated from DejaVu fonts with PIL.
One base64 blob per font; see extract_fonts.py in the work dir.
Format: ascent u16, count u16, then per glyph: code u16,
advance u8, left i8, top i8, w u8, h u8, bitmap bits MSB-first.
Char set: A-Z a-z 0-9 space and common punctuation, en/em dash,
multiplication sign, bullet, middle dot, curly quotes, ellipsis,
& % + = / $ and e-acute. 100 glyphs per font."""

